Package: EVBLM
Type: Package
Title: Empirical Variational Bayes for Longitudinal Matrix Factorization
Version: 0.0.4
Authors@R: person("EVBLM", "authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "maintainer@example.org")
Description: Fits longitudinal matrix factorization models with aligned or
    irregular observation times using empirical variational Bayes. Supports
    exchangeable and radial basis covariance models, an unrestricted aligned
    covariance model, greedy factor selection, backfitting, and imputation.
    Numerical fitting is implemented in C++ with R interfaces for validation
    and formatting and optional shrinkage loading updates from 'ebnm'.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: Rcpp
Suggests: ebnm (>= 1.1-42)
LinkingTo: Rcpp, RcppArmadillo
SystemRequirements: C++17
NeedsCompilation: yes
